{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01这类未分时出现的感受词比较密，纵向交替的排法也不如Y左右分栏那么容易一眼扫清。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键词把每段情节转折钉得更牢，观众即使没有读完所有文字，也比较容易抓住人物当下的核心念头。分时出现的感受能跟着音乐推进，水波、摇荡、失衡、靠岸等意象又反复呼应，使情绪从小心靠近到害怕失去、最终接受不确定性形成连续的发展。Y的左右分栏确实更好扫，但感受词比较像静态的情绪标签，音乐变化中的细微层次和情绪转折没有X那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1c2adec5-afab-4e6c-8505-c9395adccd3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045006202032Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:51:09.319201+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "796308d6954679cd6a2c9bea4dd586b59b9334df716f943ca6feb5200d3ffe27", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed